YOUR CODE
    │
    │  userRepo.findByName("John")
    ▼
SPRING DATA JPA
    │  Sees method name → builds JPQL:
    │  "SELECT u FROM User u WHERE u.name = ?"
    ▼
JPA (EntityManager interface)
    │  Standardized query interface
    │  Passes query down to provider
    ▼
HIBERNATE
    │  Translates JPQL → real SQL:
    │  "SELECT * FROM users WHERE full_name = ?"
    │  Executes against DB via JDBC
    │  Maps result rows → User objects
    ▼
DATABASE
    │  Returns raw data rows
    ▼
Back up the chain → List<User> returned to your code
Refrence: https://medium.com/@burakkocakeu/jpa-hibernate-and-spring-data-jpa-efa71feb82ac
